                                                "sense_id": "78aa889b-2ff2-33af-afeb-f72d113f3578",
                                                "text": "Where other trav'lers, fraught with terror, roam, Lo! Bruce in Wonder-land is quite at home."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "667a97c8-cfd0-427c-8a50-9b25887a73d2",
                                                "sense_id": "78aa889b-2ff2-33af-afeb-f72d113f3578",
                                                "text": "It's a geological wonderland, with great exposures of colorful and varied sedimentary rocks."
                                            }
